: 此NEURON mod文件由ChannelML文件生成 / This is a NEURON mod file generated from a ChannelML file

: 原始ChannelML文件采用生理单位制 / Unit system of original ChannelML file: Physiological Units

COMMENT
    包含单个通道描述的ChannelML文件 / ChannelML file containing a single Channel description
ENDCOMMENT

TITLE Channel: Leak

COMMENT
    漏电或被动电导的简单示例。注意：对于仅含单一漏电导的GENESIS细胞， / Simple example of a leak/passive conductance. Note: for GENESIS cells with a single leak conductance,
        被动电流宜使用Rm和Em变量 / it is better to use the Rm and Em variables for a passive current.
ENDCOMMENT


UNITS {
    (mA) = (milliamp)
    (mV) = (millivolt)
    (S) = (siemens)
    (um) = (micrometer)
    (molar) = (1/liter)
    (mM) = (millimolar)
    (l) = (liter)
}


    
NEURON {
      

    SUFFIX Leak
    : 存在非特异性电流 / A non specific current is present
    RANGE e
    NONSPECIFIC_CURRENT il
    
    RANGE gmax, gion,il
    
}

PARAMETER { 
      

    gmax = 0.0003 (S/cm2) : 默认值，在细胞上设置电导时应覆盖此值 / default value, should be overwritten when conductance placed on cell
    
    e = -80 (mV) : 默认值，在细胞上设置电导时应覆盖此值 / default value, should be overwritten when conductance placed on cell
    
}



ASSIGNED {
      

    v (mV)
        
    il (mA/cm2)
        
}

BREAKPOINT { 
    il = gmax*(v - e) 
        

}


